<theodulf. carm. 28.463>	Pro gressu saltus, pro plantis pinna volucris,
<theodulf. carm. 28.464>	Remige quo labi quivit ab axe poli,
<theodulf. carm. 28.465>	Et memor antiqui sceleris super aethera facti,
