<theodulf. carm. 28.468>	Plebibus ut misci dedecuisse putes:
<theodulf. carm. 28.469>	"Ecce humilis plebis fieri pars una laboras,
<theodulf. carm. 28.470>	Dum pius et clemens omnibus esse cupis.
<theodulf. carm. 28.471>	Ordo gradusque tuus levat ad sublimia temet,
