<theodulf. carm. 28.483>	Nobile par tantum horrendum insurgat in hostem,
<theodulf. carm. 28.484>	Et "Procul hinc pestis inproba", dicat, "abi".
<theodulf. carm. 28.485>	"Inproba", dicat, "abi, sociis te Manibus adde,
<theodulf. carm. 28.486>	Quorum sors sorte est adcumulata tua.
<theodulf. carm. 28.487>	I, pete Cocitum, Flegitontis mergere fundo,
<theodulf. carm. 28.488>	Quo tuus inventor trux cruciandus erit.
<theodulf. carm. 28.489>	Quique dei tecum voluit conscendere sedem,
